Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: polkitd | policykit-1
Description: Linux system maintenance and administration application
 OrbiSys provides a graphical interface and a command-line interface for
 inspecting and maintaining Linux systems. Its features include software
 inventory, system reports, storage and network tools, security checks, and
 system administration panels.
